and component provenance are described in docs/FULL_APPLICATION_RESTORATION.md.

The separate portable Node companion develops the author's earlier ZeroThink
concepts: evidence-first research processes, deterministic source retrieval, and
bounded draft, critique and revision orchestration. It was created with
coding-assistant help. Its historical provenance and design limitations are
recorded in PROVENANCE.json and docs/LOCAL_ENGINE.md.

This distribution excludes private user records, credentials, personal DNA,
database rows, runtime storage, downloaded reference/model bundles and vendor
dependencies. Publishing source does not deploy the previous hosted service.
